  </p>
  <h3>HOW TO INITIATE THE WARRANTY CLAIM PROCESS?</h3>
  <p class="warranty-footer-last-p">
    <u
      >You can complete the form above to initiate your Warranty Claim Process within 30 days from the date of purchase.</u
    ><br>
    You <u>may be required to return the defective item(s) and/or proof of purchase</u> to:<br>
    <br>
    FEED Vapor Canada, 290 Carlingview Dr, Etobicoke, ON M9W 5G1<br>
    <br>
    Please send us a clear snapshot of the shipping receipt and/or your FEED Vapor order number via email. Failure to
    return the defective item(s) and/or proof of purchase may affect your warranty claim process.<br>
    <br>
    Upon receiving the item(s), our specialists will examine them. You can expect to hear from our customer service
    representative within 2-3 business days.
    <u>If your item(s) qualify under our Warranty Policy, we will process a store credit.</u> The E-gift card will be
    sent to you in a separate email. Please check your spam folder in case you are not able to find the email. We
    apologize for any inconvenience this may have caused.<br>
    <br>
    The approved store credit for warranty claims is subject to change depending on the circumstances of the claim case.
    Warranty coverage amounts may be adjusted due to factors such as inadequate proof, the type and severity of the
    fault identified.<br>
    <br>
    <u
      >Please note that you’ll be notified by our team if the returned items do not meet warranty coverage. In such
